<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - REMEK ANNOUNCES 10PCT SHARE BUYBACK.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - REMEK ANNOUNCES 10PCT SHARE BUYBACK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmetics firm Remek announced that it will proceed with a 10 percent share buyback effective October 7 through January 8 1998.</p>
<p>The decision to implement the share buyback was taken by the company's board on Wednesday. The buyback will be limited to 539,132 shares and a price ceiling of 1,500 drachmas, Remek said.</p>
<p>The buying of the shares will be at the discretion of the company during the above mentioned period. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
